  "body": "1. **View a GitHub pull request without a local checkout.** Pass a PR URL to open its diff in the terminal, or combine it with `--web` to share a preview. The URL also works with `--pdf`, `--image`, and `--filter`.\n\n   ```bash\n   critique https://github.com/remorses/sigillo/pull/19 --web \"Sigillo PR #19\"\n   ```\n\n   Public PRs work without login. For private PRs, sign in with `gh auth login` or set `GH_TOKEN` or `GITHUB_TOKEN`."
